---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/sections/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/sections/Footer.astro';
import { t } from '../../i18n/translations';
import { contacts } from '../../config/contacts';

const tr = t.en;
---

<Layout lang="en">
  <Header lang="en" />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">

      <h1>{tr.privacy.title}</h1>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <p>
          LLC Akcept-2 is the data controller for acceptmetall.ru,
          TIN 7807277155, OGRN 1247800037473.
          Address: {t.en.contact.accept2.address}.
          This policy describes the handling of enquiries and quotation requests.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Data we process</h2>
        <p>
          The forms collect your name, company, phone, email, product requirements and message.
          File attachments are optional. Do not include personal documents or other data
          that is unnecessary for a quotation. Technical request information is used
          to limit spam and protect the service.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Purpose and processing</h2>
        <p>
          We use this information to register your request, prepare a proposal and contact you.
          An accepted request is saved and assigned a reference number.
          Email notification to our team is a separate step: a reference number confirms
          acceptance of the request, not email delivery. An error message does not confirm acceptance.
        </p>
        <p>
          The form asks for consent to processing request data in a separate field.
          You can contact us directly by email or phone if you prefer not to use the form.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Access and recipients</h2>
        <p>
          Authorised staff can access requests. Storage and email service providers may process
          the information needed to operate the service and notify our team.
          Requests are not published in a public order list. Submitting an enquiry alone
          does not subscribe you to marketing messages.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Retention and deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Records and attachments in the request intake system are automatically deleted
          after 90 days. Copies in business correspondence and documents related to
          a resulting contract may be retained separately for their processing purpose
          and applicable legal requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          Contact the controller below to request access, correction or deletion of your data,
          or to withdraw consent. Include your request reference if available.
          Withdrawal does not affect processing that has another applicable legal basis.
        </p>

        <h2>5. External resources and protection</h2>
        <p>
          Pages use system fonts and do not request fonts from Google.
          Forms are transmitted over a secure connection and saved requests are protected
          by access controls. Do not send passwords, payment credentials or information
          unrelated to your product enquiry through the forms.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Controller contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about data, recipients or retention:
          <a href={`mailto:${contacts.requestsEmail}`}>{contacts.requestsEmail}</a>.
          Phone: <a href={`tel:${contacts.accept2PhoneHref}`}>{contacts.accept2Phone}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 140px 0 80px;

    background: var(--color-bg-light);

    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 800;

    margin-bottom: 40px;

    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;

    margin: 32px 0 16px;

    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 15px;

    color: var(--color-text-muted);

    line-height: 1.8;

    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>